        "The report gives the cause: the",
        "drains are full of plastic."
      ],
      "audioText": "The report gives the cause: the drains are full of plastic.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n4-environment-results-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n4.class-73.t02",
      "en": "As a result, the street has a flood after every storm.",
      "es": "Como resultado, la calle sufre una inundación después de cada tormenta.",
      "explanationEs": "As a result + coma introduce lo que ocurre a causa de lo anterior.",
      "segments": [
